---
import { Sparkles, Youtube, ExternalLink, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 py-12 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Col 1: About Hub -->
      <div class="space-y-3 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            CEO
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Sekolah CEO AI Hub</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Dokumentasi dan playbook operasional eksekutif yang disarikan dari masterclass intensif 2 hari (~12+ jam) bersama Mas Anjas Maradita, Mas Satya Pradana, dan Pak Natali Ardianto.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-medium">
          <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span>Verbatim Transcripts & Executive Verification</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Instruktur -->
      <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
        <div class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Instruktur Masterclass
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>• <strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Mas Anjas Maradita</strong> (Daunnet Media)</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Mas Satya Pradana</strong> (High Group / Ex-CFO)</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Pak Natali Ardianto</strong> (Tiket.com / Lifepack)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Sumber Resmi -->
      <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
        <div class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Sumber Rekaman
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://s.id/Record-SekolahCEOAI-Agustus2026"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline"
            >
              YouTube Playlist Resmi <ExternalLink className="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>• Total Durasi: ~12 Jam 18 Menit</li>
          <li>• Format: 4 Sesi Rekaman Penuh</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div>© 2026 Sekolah CEO AI Executive Knowledge Base. Disusun untuk akselerasi bisnis C-Level.</div>
      <div>Dibangun dengan Astro + React Islands + Tailwind CSS</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
